cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TARANG in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TARANG: Toolkit for Automated Resonator Analysis and Nonlinear-comb Generation"
abstract: >-
  TARANG is a design and characterisation framework for integrated photonics built on
  the Tidy3D FDTD and mode-solving backend. It covers material fitting, waveguide
  dispersion engineering, ring resonators, grating and edge couplers, verified caching
  of cloud simulations with cost control, and Bayesian (nested-sampling) design search.
authors:
